OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrillions of dollars have been wiped
OL,7,Foff the stock value of major tech firms
OL,8,Fin the US, Europe and Asia amid
OL,9,Fconcerns of a slowdown in AI
OL,10,Fdevelopment
OL,12,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,13,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,14,Fmore than 5.5% by the end of Thursday,
OL,15,Flosing an estimated $2.5tn (#1.9tn) in
OL,16,Fmarket value, according to Dow Jones
OL,17,Fdata
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
