OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll eyes are now on Europe to see
OL,7,Fwhether the market sell-off of tech
OL,8,Fshares will charge on, writes our
OL,9,Fbusiness reporter - he also explains
OL,10,Fwhat's been happening in Asia trading
OL,12,FFor context: Japan, South Korea and
OL,13,FTaiwan make most of the memory chips
OL,14,Fand equipment for US AI data centres,
OL,15,Fwhich became a key issue in the recent
OL,16,Fmidterm elections
OL,18,FDemocrats in races across the US
OL,19,Fcampaigned to slow the growth of both
OL,20,Fthe centres and AI - Gina Hinojosa, who
OL,21,Fwon in Texas, pledged to halt new data
OL,22,Fcentre construction entirely
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
