OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a social media post, US President
OL,7,FDonald Trump says: "The Stock Market
OL,8,Fcrashed today because the Dumocrats had
OL,9,Fa big Tuesday", adding it was "sad to
OL,10,Fsee"
